  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a cataplana over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute more.",
    "Add the jerk seasoning and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken thighs and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the allspice, thyme, cinnamon, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the bay leaves and 1 cup of chicken broth.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the chicken is tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the meat and sauce over cauliflower rice."
